:: kitchen {"position":"900,625"}
<<scenery kitchen>>
You are currently standing in your kitchen.<<if $settings.cook && $settings.cook.npc>> <<- Person.get($settings.cook.npc).name>> is in charge of cooking.<</if>>
<<unlessEmergency>>\
    <<wanderingSlaves>>\
    <<slaveDemands Kitchen>>
    <<keyOption [[Leave your kitchen|main]] 🚪>>
    <<keyAction 'Have a meal' ☕>>
        <<set $player.energy = ($player.energy + 18).clamp(0, 100)>>
        <<addMinutes 45>>
        <<run Engine.show()>>
    <</keyAction>>: 45min + 6 Energy
    <<if $settings.cook && $settings.cook.npc>>\
        <<keyAction 'Set feeding rules' ⚙>>
            <<showCookFeedingRules>>
        <</keyAction>>
    <</if>>\
    <<sleepOption>>
<</unlessEmergency>>\